":[[0,14],[1,14]],"section":"ClientInventorySpecialItems","variantSources":{"en":0,"zh":1}},{"descriptions":{"en":"Cyte-09’s exalted Sniper Rifle. Bullets ricochet off Weak Points to seek out other nearby Weak Points. Alt fire lobs a grenade that completely freezes enemies with a <DT_FREEZE_COLOR>Cold Status Effect, leaving a freezing zone that continues to apply <DT_FREEZE_COLOR>Cold Status for a duration.","zh":"（英文：NEUTRALIZER）Cyte-09 的显赫狙击步枪。子弹从敌人的弱点弹射而出，寻找附近的其他敌人弱点。次要射击投掷的榴弹会以 <DT_FREEZE_COLOR>冰冻异常状态完全冻结敌人，并在持续时间内留下一个持续施加 <DT_FREEZE_COLOR>冰冻异常状态的冻结区域。"},"id":"/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Frumentarius/ExaltedSniper","key":"ClientInventorySpecialItems|/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Frumentarius/ExaltedSniper","names":{"en":"Neutralizer","zh":"肃清者"},"provenance":[[0,15],[1,15]],"section":"ClientInventorySpecialItems","variantSources":{"en":0,"zh":1}},{"descriptions":{"en":"These nasty things come out when Garuda forgoes a melee weapon.","zh":"当 Garuda 舍弃近战武器时，这些讨厌的东西便会出现。"},"id":"/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Garuda/GarudaClaws","key":"ClientInventorySpecialItems|/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Garuda/GarudaClaws","names":{"en":"Garuda Talons","zh":"Garuda 之爪"},"provenance":[[0,16],[1,16]],"section":"ClientInventorySpecialItems","variantSources":{"en":0,"zh":1}},{"descriptions":{"en":"These nasty things come out when Garuda Prime forgoes a melee weapon.","zh":"当 Garuda Prime 舍弃近战武器时，这些凶恶的东西便会出现。"},"id":"/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Garuda/GarudaPrimeClaws","key":"ClientInventorySpecialItems|/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Garuda/GarudaPrimeClaws","names":{"en":"Garuda Prime Talons","zh":"Garuda Prime 之爪"},"provenance":[[0,17],[1,17]],"section":"ClientInventorySpecialItems","variantSources":{"en":0,"zh":1}},{"descriptions":{"en":"Gara's devastating Shattered Lash, created by her Shattered lash ability.","zh":"Gara 的琉璃碎击能造成毁灭性的打击，由她的「琉璃碎击」技能创造。"},"id":"/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Glass/GaraShankWeapon","key":"ClientInventorySpecialItems|/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Glass/Ga