es, as projected by his Blade Storm ability.","zh":"Ash 的凶恶影分身，由他的「剑刃风暴」技能创造。"},"id":"/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Ninja/NinjaStormWeapon","key":"ClientInventorySpecialItems|/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Ninja/NinjaStormWeapon","names":{"en":"Shadow Clones","zh":"影分身"},"provenance":[[0,28],[1,28]],"section":"ClientInventorySpecialItems","variantSources":{"en":0,"zh":1}},{"descriptions":{"en":"Ash Prime's fearsome Shadow Clones, as projected by his Blade Storm ability.","zh":"Ash Prime 的凶恶影分身，由他的「剑刃风暴」技能创造。"},"id":"/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Ninja/NinjaStormWeaponPrime","key":"ClientInventorySpecialItems|/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Ninja/NinjaStormWeaponPrime","names":{"en":"Shadow Clones Prime","zh":"影分身 Prime"},"provenance":[[0,29],[1,29]],"section":"ClientInventorySpecialItems","variantSources":{"en":0,"zh":1}},{"descriptions":{"en":"Baruuk channels the desert wind to turn his fists and feet into an exalted weapon.","zh":"（英文：DESERT WIND）Baruuk 把沙漠之风转移到他的双拳和脚掌，使之成为了一件显赫武器。"},"id":"/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Pacifist/PacifistFist","key":"ClientInventorySpecialItems|/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Pacifist/PacifistFist","names":{"en":"Desert Wind","zh":"沙漠之风"},"provenance":[[0,30],[1,30]],"section":"ClientInventorySpecialItems","variantSources":{"en":0,"zh":1}},{"descriptions":{"en":"Baruuk Prime channels the Desert Wind to turn his fists and feet into an exalted prime weapon.","zh":"（英文：DESERT WIND PRIME）Baruuk Prime 把沙漠之风转移到他的双拳和脚掌，使之成为了一件显赫 Prime 武器。"},"id":"/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Pacifist/PacifistFistPrime","key":"ClientInventorySpecialItems|/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Pacifist/PacifistFistPrime","names":{"en":"Desert Wind Prime","zh":"沙漠之风 Prime"},"provenance":[[0,31],[1,31]],"section":"ClientInventorySpecialItems","variantSources":{"en":0,"zh":1}},{"descriptions":{"en":"Wield the power of Dante's chronicles. Customize Noctua with Tome Mods that enhance Warframe Abilities and reward strategic combat. Primary attack releases pages that tear into lethal pieces on hits. Its alternate attack releases a wave with infinite Punch Through.","zh":"（英文：NOCTUA）掌握 Dante 编年史的力量。为夜枭安装典籍 Mod 以增强战甲技能并获得战术优势。主要攻击释放的书页在命中后会碎裂成致命的碎片。次要攻击会释放具有无限穿透的攻击波。"},"id":"/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Pagemaster/ExaltedBook","key":"ClientInventorySpecialItems|/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Pagemaster/ExaltedBook","names":{"en":"Noctua","zh":"夜枭"},"provenance":[[0,32],[1,32]],"section":"ClientInventorySpecialItems","variantSources":{"en":0,"zh":1}},{"descriptions":{"en":"Summon a mighty bow and unleash a volley of devastating arrows.","zh":"召唤出一把强力长弓并发动毁灭性的集中箭矢射击。"},"id":"/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Ranger/ExaltedBow","key":"ClientInventorySpecialItems|/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Ranger/ExaltedBow","names":{"en":"Artemis Bow","zh":"月神狩弓"},"provenance":[[0,33],[1,33]],"section":"ClientInventorySpecialItems","variantSources":{"en":0,"zh":1}},{"descriptions":{"en":null,"zh":null},"id":"/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Ranger/PrimeExaltedBow","key":"ClientInventorySpecialItems|/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Ranger/PrimeExaltedBow","names":{"en":"Artemis Bow Prime","zh":"月神狩弓 Prime"},"provenance":[[0,34],[1,34]],"section":"ClientInventorySpecialItems","variantSources":{"en":0,"zh":1}},{"descriptions":{"en":"Wield the power of the stars in a constant battle for supremacy. The dueling sons, Sirius & Orion, occupy the space of a single Warframe, jockeying for position to rain cosmic destruction upon foes.","zh":"在永无休止的霸权争夺战中，驾驭星辰之力。Sirius 与 Orion 这对决斗之子，在同一个战甲中，彼此角力，争相占据有利位置，向敌人倾泻宇宙级的毁灭之力。"},"id":"/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/SiriusOrion/OrionSuit","key":"ClientInventorySpecialItems|/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/SiriusOrion/OrionSuit","names":{"en":"Orion & Sirius","zh":"Orion & Sirius"},"provenance":[[0,35],[1,35]],"section":"ClientInventorySpecialItems","variantSources":{"en":0,"zh":1}},{"descriptions":{"en":"Lizzie was born from Flare’s own Techrot-infested blood. More than a mere instrument, she thrums with fire-spitting fury.","zh":"（英文：LIZZIE）丽兹诞生于弗莱尔被科腐者感染的血液中。她演奏出的不仅有美妙的音符，还有狂热的怒火。"},"id":"/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Temple/ExaltedGuitar","key":"ClientInventorySpecialItems|/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Temple/ExaltedGuitar","names":{"en":"Lizzie","zh":"丽兹"},"provenance":[[0,36],[1,36]],"section":"ClientInventorySpecialItems","variantSources":{"en":0,"zh":1}},{"descriptions":{"en":"Sevagoth's roving spirit, formed from concentrated Void energy.","zh":"Sevagoth 的游魂，由凝聚的虚空能量形成。"},"id":"/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Wraith/Reaper","key":"ClientInventorySpecialItems|/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Wraith/Reaper","names":{"en":"Sevagoth's Shadow","zh":"Sevagoth 的幽影"},"provenance":[[0,37],[1,37]],"section":"ClientInventorySpecialItems","variantSources":{"en":0,"zh":1}},{"descriptions":{"en":"These razor-sharp blades of condensed Void energy inflict deep and grievous wounds.","zh":"这些凝聚虚空能量的锋利之刃能造成了深切而痛苦的伤口。"},"id":"/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Wraith/ReaperMeleeWeapon","key":"ClientInventorySpecialItems|/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Wraith/ReaperMeleeWeapon","names":{"en":"Shadow Claws","zh":"幽影之爪"},"provenance":[[0,38],[1,38]],"section":"ClientInventorySpecialItems","variantSources":{"en":0,"zh":1}},{"descriptions":{"en":"When the Tempestarii became a void phantom, Sevagoth set aside his body and became a Shadow, to continue his solemn duty of saving lives.","zh":"当「风暴使者号」成为虚空诡舰，Sevagoth 舍弃身躯，化为幽影来继续肩负庄严的救援职责。"},"id":"/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Wraith/SevagothShadowPrime","key":"ClientInventorySpecialItems|/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Wraith/SevagothShadowPrime","names":{"en":"Sevagoth Prime's Shadow","zh":"Sevagoth Prime 的幽影"},"provenance":[[0,39],[1,39]],"section":"ClientInventorySpecialItems","variantSources":{"en":0,"zh":1}},{"descriptions":{"en":"The claws of the shadowy helmsman have cast many foolish foes into the cold below.","zh":"幽影舵手的利爪已将众多愚蠢的敌人投入幽寒深处。"},"id":"/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Wraith/SevagothShadowPrimeClawsWeapon","key":"ClientInventorySpecialItems|/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Wraith/SevagothShadowPrimeClawsWeapon","names":{"en":"Shadow Claws Prime","zh":"幽影之爪 Prime"},"provenance":[[0,40],[1,40]],"section":"ClientInventorySpecialItems","variantSources":{"en":0,"zh":1}},{"descriptions":{"en":"Yareli Prime’s living board is the epitome of elegance and style.","zh":"Yareli Prime 的生物滑板是优雅和风格的缩影。"},"id":"/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Yareli/BoardPrimeSuit","key":"ClientInventorySpecialItems|/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Yareli/BoardPrimeSuit","names":{"en":"Merulina Prime","zh":"浪漪珊瑚 Prime"},"provenance":[[0,41],[1,41]],"section":"ClientInventorySpecialItems","variantSources":{"en":0,"zh":1}},{"descriptions":{"en":"Summon Merulina, a rideable creature of the waves, and the inspiration for K-Driving. Merulina protects Yareli by absorbing a large portion of incoming damage.","zh":"召唤浪漪珊瑚，这是一种浪涌中的可骑乘生物，也是 K 式悬浮板的灵感来源。浪漪珊瑚通过吸收大部分来袭的伤害从而保护 Yareli。"},"id":"/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Yareli/BoardSuit","key":"ClientInventorySpecialItems|/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Yareli/BoardSuit","names":{"en":"Merulina","zh":"浪漪珊瑚"},"provenance":[[0,42],[1,42]],"section":"ClientInventorySpecialItems","variantSources":{"en":0,"zh":1}},{"descriptions":{"en":"A titanic blade modeled after some of the very oldest swords, this weapon was designed to slice through massed enemy troops in a single stroke.","zh":"（英文：IRONBRIDE）一把灵感源自最古老刀剑的巨大利刃，这把武器是为了一次性击穿大量敌人而设计的。"},"id":"/Lotus/StoreItems/Types/Enemies/Orokin/Entrati/EntratiTech/NechroTech/AbilitySword/NechroTechSwordWeapon","key":"ClientInventorySpecialItems|/Lotus/StoreItems/Types/Enemies/Orokin/Entrati/EntratiTech/NechroTech/AbilitySword/NechroTechSwordWeapon","names":{"en":"Ironbride","zh":"铁嫁"},"provenance":[[0,43],[1,43]],"section":"ClientInventorySpecialItems","variantSources":{"en":0,"zh":1}},{"descriptions":{"en":"The pinnacle of Entrati weapons design: dual energy mortars that fire with such devastating power that the Necramech must first be locked into a braced, stationary turret mode.","zh":"（英文：ARQUEBEX）英择谛武器设计的巅峰之作：双能追击炮的毁灭威力之大，使